{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_10\">Problem 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given the following six statements:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/4/8b4895c70b5a5f213fc788dd36282abdda113eea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(1) All women are good drivers}\\]\" width=\"225\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/e/fce78ab7dbf59f07001747415c05eaca07fadc28.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(2) Some women are good drivers}\\]\" width=\"242\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/9/8f923abd2a1e882968ae2eb896bdc580c3a9eca5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(3) No men are good drivers}\\]\" width=\"204\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/2/8724677501bea949fc6bce4ee0f9aa2a7373ed79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(4) All men are bad drivers}\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/7/d279104945e6078b816bf516d1019ae80b675cf2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(5) At least one man is a bad driver}\\]\" width=\"260\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c65b733bfc10fbd17953d943eaf7ac7c2e4f3a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{(6) All men are good drivers.}\\]\" width=\"209\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe statement that negates statement <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd8597460a07f59450a07e0f94607fcb479cf974.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc132950ea8f51fad772eec45ae7c3c89c1e567.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }(1)\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }(2)\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }(3)\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }(4)\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }(5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"422\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e35de11423e9ff6e70c789fec0fba08cda8f159.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{(E)5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"46\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>If you look at (5) and (6), if either one of them are false, it implies that the other one is true and vice versa≥\nalso haiyaaaa hwy u no know solve it treeveal cheevian. @dhar\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=196